OL,3,GNEWSAMichael Sheen hopes
OL,4,A'extraordinary' reaction to toxic waste
OL,5,Adocumentary spurs action
OL,6,
OL,7,FMichael Sheen has welcomed the reaction
OL,8,Fto his documentary investigating Wales'
OL,9,Ftoxic waste legacy, saying he hopes it
OL,10,Fpushes the relevant authorities to
OL,11,F"find a solution".
OL,13,FDozens of people contacted BBC Wales
OL,14,Ffollowing coverage of Sheen's
OL,15,Finvestigation into chemical giant
OL,16,FMonsanto and the dumping of
OL,17,Fpolychlorinated biphenyls (PCBs).
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
