OL,3,GNEWSAMichael Sheen hopes
OL,4,A'extraordinary' reaction to toxic waste
OL,5,Adocumentary spurs action
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne of them was a former Monsanto
OL,8,Fworker who spent three years helping to
OL,9,Fseal toxic waste underground and said
OL,10,Fstaff had "cheap" protective equipment
OL,11,Fand were not told what they were
OL,12,Fburying.
OL,14,FEastman Chemical Company, which is
OL,15,Fresponsible for Monsanto's legacy
OL,16,Fproduction in the UK, did not respond
OL,17,Fto either Sheen and his team or the BBC
OL,18,Fwhen asked to comment.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
